	"data": "Room 2.0 — Multiplayer Vocabulary Extensions & Command Bus\n\nAdditive extensions to the room2# vocabulary for multiplayer support. Nothing existing changes — all new classes, predicates, and enumerations layer on top.\n\nNew Classes\n\nroom2:Player (subclass of room2:SpatialEntity)\nroom2:hasSession → room2:Session\nroom2:playerRole → room2:PlayerRole (host, visitor, observer)\nroom2:clientMode → room2:ClientMode (AR, VR, Desktop)\nroom2:hasPermission → room2:Permission\nroom2:hasPresence →…",
